<title>USA: Bob Evans says to buy back shrs, sets div.</title>
<headline>Bob Evans says to buy back shrs, sets div.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bob Evans Farms Inc said its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 1,000,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said purchases will be made during its 1998 fiscal year, which is April 26, 1997 through April 24, 1998.</p>
<p>The company said it had 42,638,118 common shares issued as of April 25, 1997.</p>
<p>The company also said it was declaring a quarterly dividend of $0.08 per share on the outstanding corporate stock (0.01 par value.).</p>
<p>The company said the dividend is payable June 2 to shareholders of record May 16.</p>
</text>
